#
#   property_parsing_1 - parsing property values: lists, shorthands and values for properties
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/CSS/Parser/PropertyParsing.cpp (lines 1-368): a keyword as the whole
#       value, simple and coordinating comma-separated value lists, and the value of one of
#       several properties (keywords, custom idents, then each value type the properties
#       accept, in the C++ order).
